        "Id": "a124c9ba-32e7-4080-bd1e-f881ea88599b",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "There&apos;s Sun Ting Rong With My Food",
        "Location": "LOCATION_WET_RAT",
        "PublicId": "130491957290",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f839f257-1f7b-43cd-923e-9337218f2f56).Image",
        "Description": "A mysterious food delivery has gone horribly wrong. Your order was supposed to include sweet, savory, and satisfying—but instead, you got Sun, Ting, and Rong. Now these three “ingredients” are leaving a bad taste in everyone’s mouth.\r\rEliminate Mei Sun, Chen Ting, and Rong Lin with precision and a dash of creativity. Make it clean, make it clever—and maybe, just maybe, you’ll finally get your food… the way you ordered it.",
